SKIN | stone-arch | Stone arch | &.widgits/taskbar-settings/skins/stone-arch/left | &.widgits/taskbar-settings/skins/stone-arch/mid | &.widgits/taskbar-settings/skins/stone-arch/right
SKIN | metal-truss | Metal truss | &.widgits/taskbar-settings/skins/metal-truss/left | &.widgits/taskbar-settings/skins/metal-truss/mid | &.widgits/taskbar-settings/skins/metal-truss/right
